7 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/AP<</N 23 0 R>>/BS<</S/S/W 1>>/DA(0.066667 0.066667 0.066667 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DV()/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/MK<</BC[.721569 .721569 .721569]/BG[1 1 1]>>/P 6 0 R/Rect[42 547.8898 553.2756 595.8898]/T(one_line_summary)/V(Ordo is a CFO for small companies: it reads their receipts, invoices and bank data on its own, predicts the bank balance day by day and prepares fixes that run only after the owner approves.)>>
