8 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/AP<</N 24 0 R>>/BS<</S/S/W 1>>/DA(0.066667 0.066667 0.066667 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DV()/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/MK<</BC[.721569 .721569 .721569]/BG[1 1 1]>>/P 6 0 R/Rect[42 401.8898 553.2756 489.8898]/T(technology_stack)/V(Backend: Python, FastAPI, PostgreSQL \(data and event queue\)\nFrontend: TypeScript, React, Vite\nBank simulator: Python, FastAPI, Berlin Group NextGenPSD2 account-information format\nAI: gpt-oss-20b on vLLM, docling-serve \(OCR\), Whisper \(speech\), OGX and MCP, NeMo Guardrails, MLflow\nPlatform: Red Hat OpenShift AI with one NVIDIA L4 GPU, Prometheus, Grafana, GitHub Actions\nData sources: IMAP mailbox, NBP exchange-rate API, KSeF e-invoice files, the bank simulator)>>
endobj

